---
import { featuredGuides, guideCategories, getGuidesByCategory, type GuideCategory } from "../data/guides";
import GuideCard from "./GuideCard.astro";

const categories = Object.keys(guideCategories) as GuideCategory[];
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div><div class="eyebrow">START HERE</div><h2>先看这三篇</h2></div>
      <p>如果正在准备植物提取物采购或原料规格确认，先从参数、COA 和文件区别开始，通常能减少一半以上的来回沟通。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="guide-grid guide-grid-three">
      {featuredGuides.map((guide) => <GuideCard guide={guide} />)}
    </div>

    <div class="section-heading" style="margin-top:4.5rem">
      <div><div class="eyebrow">KNOWLEDGE MAP</div><h2>按采购阶段浏览</h2></div>
      <p>从规格准备、质量文件、供应商评估到脂质体技术指标，按你当前要解决的问题进入。</p>
    </div>

    {categories.map((key) => {
      const category = guideCategories[key];
      const items = getGuidesByCategory(key);
      return (
        <section class="guide-category">
          <div class="guide-category-head">
            <span>{category.short}</span>
            <h2>{category.label}</h2>
            <p>{category.description}</p>
          </div>
          <div class="guide-list">
            {items.map((guide, index) => (
              <a class="guide-row" href={`/zh/resources/${guide.slug}/`}>
                <span class="guide-row-index">0{index + 1}</span>
                <div class="guide-row-body">
                  <h3>{guide.title}</h3>
                  <p>{guide.description}</p>
                </div>
                <span class="guide-row-meta">{guide.readingMinutes} 分钟 ↗</span>
              </a>
            ))}
          </div>
        </section>
      );
    })}

    <div class="content-callout" style="margin-top:3rem">
      <strong>没有找到对应的问题？</strong>
      <p>可以直接提交目标成分、规格、应用和目的市场。我们会先判断需要补充哪些参数，再讨论供应选项，而不是先给一个无法比较的价格。</p>
      <a class="button" href="/zh/contact/?interest=采购指南&type=guide">提交采购问题 ↗</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
